# Coding standards (from agent-state)

Full detail: `agent-state/coding-standards.md`.

## Python

- Type hints on all public functions; docstrings with Args/Returns
- `async def` for I/O; never hop asyncpg via `asyncio.to_thread`
- Wrap HTTP/DB/model calls in `try/except`; log with `logging.getLogger(__name__)`
- Comments only for *why*, not *what*; no wildcard imports

## FastAPI

- Pydantic `BaseModel` for bodies; factory apps (`create_app --factory`)
- Localhost HTTP: `httpx.AsyncClient(timeout=120, trust_env=False)` (Squid proxy hangs otherwise)
- Guardrails upstream overflow → `finish_reason="length"` (not `"error"`)

## DB / retrieval

- `async with db.session() as session:`
- Dense index: use `_ensure_model()` / `_dense_encode()`, never assume `dense.model`
- Entity lists: embed via `SentenceTransformerEmbedder.embed_texts(title + desc)`
- Context budget: Triton Gemma 8192 tokens — trim supplements (top-3 × 4KB); keep prompts ~20K chars

## Persian

- Normalize via `preprocessor/persian.py` / `regex_persian.py`
- Synonym map in `query_expansion.py`; BM25 = tantivy Persian word + 3-gram
- Embed: `paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2` (384d)

## Gemma serving

- `chat_template_kwargs:{"enable_thinking":false}` + `--no-mmproj --jinja`
